            "list_type": null,
            "level": null,
            "order": 2,
            "text": "The backend receives the uploaded document through the FastAPI API and passes it to a single document_parser.py file. This parser calls the paragraph, table, and image extractors, collects their outputs into a common JSON schema, preserves the original document order, and generates one unified JSON for the entire document. The final JSON is then saved as a .json file, which will be used in the next stages of the project, such as translation and document reconstruction.",
